            "review_title": "Review at La Place",
            "review_text": "Just Joe\nNapa, California555 contributions\n0\nDISAPPOINTED. Poor Service, average food\nApr 2026 • Solo\nVERY DISAPPOINTED. UNFRIENDLY STAFF, average food, dirty, it has regressed. Ate there a couple of years ago when vacationing in Hanoi, it was a good restaurant then. Now, ALL STAFF unfriendly and apathetic about serving you. Place was nearly empty at prime dinner time. Ate on balcony, counter overlooking street was filthy and not been cleaned since last customer. Female employee sitting in balcony room was only using her cell phone, not helping. Had to go downstairs for assistance. Food is now average, at best. Older woman cashing out down below was chastising me for using a credit card. UNPLEASANT EXPERIENCE. DO NOT RECOMMEND!\nRead more\nWritten April 14, 2026",
